---
description: Delivery folder and output contracts
alwaysApply: true
---

Every successful delivery must populate:

deliveries/YYYY-MM-DD/

Expected folders/concepts:
- canonical_source
- wizard_of_odds
- derek_forward_feed
- derek_game_snapshots
- pmf_model_review_package
- after_game_scoring when outcomes are available

Canonical model-only source:
deliveries/YYYY-MM-DD/canonical_source/player_prop_pmfs_tonight_MODEL_ONLY.parquet

This file must be model-only.
Do not market-anchor it.

Before committing deliveries:
- stamp champion metadata
- strip empty delivery columns
- write review previews
- enforce CSV size contract
- verify delivery folder contract
- validate PMF math
- validate daily PMF delivery
- verify Derek forward feed

CSV contract:
- user-facing CSVs must be <= 524288 bytes
- full large data should remain parquet
- oversized CSVs should be previewed/split
- never modify derek_unique_props_summary.csv as part of size enforcement

If BDL player props are empty for an old/completed slate:
- valid-skip BDL-only Derek main-line summary
- do not fabricate lines
- write structured status
- do not kill model-only delivery if PMFs and delivery contracts otherwise pass
